  "description": "Seok-Yeong is a novelist who has been crushing on a friend for a long time. Time passes, and his friend's son, Yun-Ho (who really takes after his father) finds Seok-Yeong and announces something unexpected: they will now be living together! Whether or not Yun-Ho is aware of how Seok-Yeong is pained by the way he thinks of his crush whenever he sees him, he naturally touches him in dizzying ways... Will this cohabitation really be okay?",
